# Used by Cloudflare Pages (wrangler) instead of .gitignore when uploading
# the exported `dist/` folder. Left empty on purpose: Expo nests some
# exported npm-package assets (icon fonts, navigation icons) under paths
# containing a "node_modules" segment (e.g. dist/assets/node_modules/@expo/...),
# and .gitignore's `node_modules/` rule would otherwise make wrangler skip
# uploading those real, needed files.
